╭ Keys ───────────────────────────────── 28-49 of 49 · j/k scroll · Esc closes ╮
│Treemap  hjkl Enter b    move · zoom, then drill · conns/bytes · Esc out      │
│Traffic  w               draft allow rule from a blocked flow or row (writes) │
│Form     Ctrl-N Ctrl-P   complete from the index · cycle back                 │
│Filter   Ctrl-N Ctrl-P   complete the filter fields · cycle back              │
│w form   Ctrl-A Ctrl-R   all labels · new ruleset                             │
│Policy   d               toggle draft / active                                │
│Policy   p               pending changes                                      │
│Policy   Tab / Enter     pane · rule detail · on a ruleset: load deny rules   │
│Policy   N               new deny rule in the selected ruleset (rules pane)   │
│Policy   i               rule impact: load the workloads once (1 request)     │
│Objects  Tab / Enter     next tab: labels, groups, services, IP lists · detail│
│Labels   f / i / u       key filter · ignored keys · unused only (asks first) │
│Labels   /=text /k=text  search values only · the values of key k             │
│IP lists Enter           detail: ranges · FQDNs · size · rules using it       │
│Workloads t/T h H Enter  Traffic as src/dst · unhealthy · health sort · detail│
│Events   f / Enter / S   filter · event as JSON · sort by severity            │
│n / e / x (writes)       new/edit/delete: Objects, IP lists, Workloads, Policy│
│Pending  j/k Space Enter select · mark · diff of a pending entry              │
│Pending  P               provision the marked entries, or all (writes)        │
│Pending  R               revert marked entries (draft-only ones are deleted)  │
│y / n                    send / cancel a shown request                        │
│Esc                      close overlay / cancel                               │
